contentText:
John Rich believes Jelly Roll knew the potential consequences that would come with getting candid about politics, including the possibility that some of his own fans might stop listening.

The Big & Rich singer discussed Jelly Roll&#8217;s recent guest-hosting stint on Jimmy Kimmel Live! during an episode of The Benny Show , arguing that the country star likely knew the repercussions of his comments. Furthermore, Rich said that what the country singer said could clash with the assumptions some listeners had made about him.

